 COMBOBOX IDC_KICQ_XSTATUS_LIST, 8, 23, 244, 120, CBS_DROPDOWNLIST | CBS_OWNERDRAWFIXED | CBS_HASSTRINGS | WS_VSCROLL | WS_TABSTOP
